---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
---
<Page title="About" description="Who makes Acme anvils and why.">
  <section data-section="about-hero"><div class="wrap">
    <h1>Four generations, one very heavy product.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Acme started in a barn in 1952 and has been dropping things on deadlines ever since.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section data-section="story"><div class="wrap">
    <h2>Our story</h2>
    <p>We make one thing and make it well. Our forge runs on recycled steel and a stubborn belief that heavy things should arrive on time.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section data-section="team"><div class="wrap">
    <h2>The team</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card"><h3>Wilma Acme</h3><p>Founder and head blacksmith.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Raj Patel</h3><p>Logistics. Has never lost an anvil.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Sam Okafor</h3><p>Customer care, and keeper of the guarantee.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</Page>
